<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id" />
  <para style="h">EJIRA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Ejira</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ejira</para>
  <para style="toc3">Eji</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">EJIRA</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Buk pa Ejira </char> kube tutwale ki buk me Tekwaro, dok tito kit ma Lujudaya mogo gudwogo kwede ki i opii ki i lobo Babilon, ki tito bene roco Ot pa Lubanga kacel ki roco woro i Ot pa Lubanga. Lok magi ducu kitito i dul adek: (1) Lujudaya ma gukwongo dwogo ki i lobo Babilon ikare me loc pa rwot Ciro me Percia. (2) Roco Ot pa Lubanga, dyerone ki cako woro odoco i Jerucalem. (3) Inge mwaki mukene Ejira, ma en dano ma ngene ilok me Cik pa Lubanga, otelo wi Lujudaya mukene me dwogo i Jerucalem. Ejira oyubu dano me woro Lubanga ki gwoko niyegi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Dwogo mukwongo ki i opii <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZR 1:1-2:70">1:1—2:70</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Roco ki kwero Ot pa Lubanga <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZR 3:1-6:22">3:1—6:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ejira odwogo ki jo mukene <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZR 7:1-10:44">7:1—10:44</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ciro ociko ni Lujudaya gudok cen i lobogi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 36:22-23">2 Tek 36:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:11">Jer 25:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:10">29:10</ref></char>
    </note>I mwaka mukwongo me loc pa Ciro rwot me Percia, Rwot Lubanga oweko lok mayam oa ki idog Jeremia ocobe kakare. Rwot Lubanga otugu cwiny Ciro rwot me Percia omiyo en otito lok oromo i lobo ma ite kere ducu. Rwot Ciro ocoyo i waragane kitman:<verse eid="EZR 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:28">Ica 44:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Man aye lok ma Ciro rwot me Percia ociko: Rwot, ma en Lubanga me polo, otyeko miyo ker ducu ma iwi lobo i cinga, dok ocika ni ager ot pire i Jerucalem matye i Juda. <verse eid="EZR 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3" />Bot ngat mo keken ma ikinwu matye ikin lwak pa Lubanga awaco ni Lubanga myero obed kwede. Dano meno omyero oa ocit i Jerucalem, matye i Juda, kagero Ot pa Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, ma kiworo i Jerucalem. <verse eid="EZR 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4" />Pieno dano acel acel ma pud odong i kabedo mo ma en bedo iye, wek jo ma i kabedo meno gumiye kony me ryal ki jabu, kacel ki kit jami mo keken ki lim makwo, kun kimedo ikom gityer ma igi opwoyo ma kimiyo pi Ot pa Lubanga matye i Jerucalem.”<verse eid="EZR 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5" />Ludito ma giloyo dog odi pa kwarigi ma gitye i kaka pa Juda ki Benjamin, ajwaki pa Lubanga, Lulevi kacel ki jo ducu ma Lubanga otugu cwinygi, gucako yube me cito kagero Ot pa Rwot matye i Jerucalem odoco. <verse eid="EZR 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6" />Jo ducu ma orumugi gumiyogi kony me jami me ryal, jabu, ki lwak jami mapatpat, kacel ki lim makwo, ki mot ma welgi dongo, medo ikom lim ducu ma dano gutyero ma cwinygi opwoyo me miyone.<verse eid="EZR 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7" />Rwot Ciro bene okwanyo jami mayam kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Rwot, mayam Nebukadnejar oyako ki i Jerucalem ci otero oketo i ot jok pa lubangane. <verse eid="EZR 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8" />Ciro rwot me Percia okelogi ci omiyogi i cing Mitredat ma lakan lim, en okwano lwak jami meno ducu inyim Cecbajar ma en rwot me Juda. <verse eid="EZR 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9" />Wel jami onongo yam tye kit man: becen madongo me jabu pyere adek, becen me ryal alip acel, atabo weer me wango odok eceta pyere aryo wiye abongwen, <verse eid="EZR 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10" />atabo matino me jabu pyere adek, atabo me ryal miya angwen ki apar, ki jami mukene alip acel; <verse eid="EZR 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11" />jami me jabu ki me ryal ducu oromo alip abic ki miya angwen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wel jami ma kicoyo ityeng 9-10 tye 2499 keken ento pe 5400 kit ma kicoyo ityeng 11. Man nyutu ni jami mukene pe kiryeyo nyinggi piny i buk man.</char></note> Jami magi ducu Cecbajar odwokogi i Jerucalem ikare ma jo mayam kiterogi i opii i Babilon kidwokogi cen i Jerucalem.<verse eid="EZR 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2" />
  <para style="s1">Wel dano ma gudwogo cen ki i opii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NEH 7:4-73">Nek 7:4-73</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1" />Magi aye jo me lobo Juda mayam kiyakogi ci kiterogi i opii i lobo Babilon ma Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon con otweyogi kunu: ci gudwogo i Jerucalem ki i Juda, kun dano acel acel dok i taune kikome. <verse eid="EZR 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2" />Gin gudwogo cen kacel ki jo magi: Jerubabel, Yocwa, Nekemia, Ceraya, Reelaya, Mordekai, Bilcan, Micpar, Bigvai, Rekum, ki Baana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 2:2">Man aye wel dano ma i kaka pa jo Icrael: <verse eid="EZR 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3" />likwayo pa Paroc, alip aryo ki miya acel ki pyere abiro wiye aryo.<verse eid="EZR 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4" />Likwayo pa Cepatia, miya adek ki pyere abiro wiye aryo. <verse eid="EZR 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5" />Likwayo pa Ara, miya abiro ki pyere abiro wiye abic. <verse eid="EZR 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6" />Likwayo pa Pakat-moab, ma gin aye likwayo pa Yocwa ki Joab, alip aryo ki miya aboro ki apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="EZR 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7" />Ki likwayo pa Elam, alip acel ki miya aryo ki pyere abic wiye angwen. <verse eid="EZR 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8" />Likwayo pa Jatu, miya abongwen ki pyere angwen wiye abic. <verse eid="EZR 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9" />Likwayo pa Jakai, miya abiro ki pyere abicel. <verse eid="EZR 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10" />Likwayo pa Bani, miya abicel ki pyere angwen wiye aryo. <verse eid="EZR 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11" />Likwayo pa Bebai, miya abicel ki pyere aryo wiye adek. <verse eid="EZR 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12" />Likwayo pa Ajgad, alip acel ki miya aryo ki pyere aryo wiye aryo. <verse eid="EZR 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13" />Likwayo pa Adonikam, miya abicel ki pyere abicel wiye abicel. <verse eid="EZR 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14" />Likwayo pa Bigvai, alip aryo ki pyere abic wiye abicel. <verse eid="EZR 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15" />Likwayo pa Adin, miya angwen ki pyere abic wiye angwen. <verse eid="EZR 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16" />Likwayo pa Ater, ma en aye likwayo pa Kejekia, pyere abongwen wiye aboro. <verse eid="EZR 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17" />Likwayo pa Bejai, miya adek ki pyere aryo wiye adek. <verse eid="EZR 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18" />Likwayo pa Jora, miya acel ki apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="EZR 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19" />Likwayo pa Kacum, miya aryo ki pyere aryo wiye adek. <verse eid="EZR 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20" />Likwayo pa Gibar, pyere abongwen wiye abic, <verse eid="EZR 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21" />jo Beterekem, miya acel ki pyere aryo wiye adek. <verse eid="EZR 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22" />Jo Netopa, pyere abic wiye abicel. <verse eid="EZR 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23" />Jo Anatot, miya acel ki pyere aryo wiye aboro. <verse eid="EZR 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24" />Jo Ajimavet, pyere angwen wiye aryo. <verse eid="EZR 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25" />Jo Kiriatarim, jo Kepira, ki jo Beerot, miya abiro ki pyere angwen wiye adek. <verse eid="EZR 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26" />Jo Rama ki jo Geba, miya abicel ki pyere aryo wiye acel. <verse eid="EZR 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27" />Jo Mikmac, miya acel ki pyere aryo wiye aryo. <verse eid="EZR 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28" />Jo Betel ki Ai, miya aryo ki pyere aryo wiye adek. <verse eid="EZR 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29" />Jo Nebo, pyere abic wiye aryo, <verse eid="EZR 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30" />jo Magbie, miya acel ki pyere abic wiye abicel. <verse eid="EZR 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31" />Jo Elam mukenene, alip acel ki miya aryo ki pyere abic wiye angwen. <verse eid="EZR 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32" />Jo Karim, miya adek ki pyere aryo. <verse eid="EZR 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33" />Jo Lod, jo Kadid, ki jo Ono, miya abiro ki pyere aryo wiye abic. <verse eid="EZR 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34" />Jo Jeriko, miya adek ki pyere angwen wiye abic. <verse eid="EZR 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35" />Jo Cenaa alip adek ki miya abicel ki pyere adek.<verse eid="EZR 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36" />Magi aye wel ajwaki pa Lubanga: likwayo pa Jedaya, ma i dog ot pa Yocwa, miya abongwen ki pyere abiro wiye adek. <verse eid="EZR 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37" />Likwayo pa Imer, alip acel ki pyere abic wiye aryo. <verse eid="EZR 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38" />Likwayo pa Packur, alip acel ki miya aryo ki pyere angwen wiye abiro. <verse eid="EZR 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39" />Likwayo pa Karim, alip acel ki apar wiye abiro.<verse eid="EZR 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40" />Man aye wel Lulevi: Likwayo pa Yocwa ki Kadmiel, ma ikin likwayo pa Kodavia, pyere abiro wiye angwen. <verse eid="EZR 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41" />Luwer ma likwayo pa Acap, miya acel ki pyere aryo wiye aboro. <verse eid="EZR 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42" />Likwayo pa lugwok dogola ma gin likwayo pa Calum, likwayo pa Ater, likwayo pa Talmon, likwayo pa Akub, likwayo pa Katita, ki likwayo pa Cobai, gin ducu onongo giromo miya acel ki pyere adek wiye abongwen.<verse eid="EZR 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43" />Magi aye lutic i Ot pa Lubanga: likwayo pa Jika, likwayo pa Kacupa, likwayo pa Tabaot, <verse eid="EZR 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44" />likwayo pa Keroc, likwayo pa Ciaka, likwayo pa Padon, <verse eid="EZR 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45" />likwayo pa Lebana, likwayo pa Agaba, likwayo pa Akub, <verse eid="EZR 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46" />likwayo pa Kagab, likwayo pa Camlai, likwayo pa Kanan, <verse eid="EZR 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47" />likwayo pa Gidel, likwayo pa Gakar, likwayo pa Re-aya, <verse eid="EZR 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48" />likwayo pa Rejin, likwayo pa Nekoda, likwayo pa Gajam, <verse eid="EZR 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49" />likwayo pa Uja, likwayo pa Pacea, likwayo pa Becai, <verse eid="EZR 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50" />likwayo pa Acna, likwayo pa Meunim, likwayo pa Nepicim, <verse eid="EZR 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51" />likwayo pa Bakbuk, likwayo pa Akupa, likwayo pa Arur, <verse eid="EZR 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52" />likwayo pa Bajlut, likwayo pa Mekida, likwayo pa Arca, <verse eid="EZR 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53" />likwayo pa Barkoc, likwayo pa Cicera, likwayo pa Tema, <verse eid="EZR 2:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54" />likwayo pa Nejia, ki likwayo pa Atipa.<verse eid="EZR 2:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55" />Likwayo pa lutic pa Solomon gin aye: likwayo pa Cotai, likwayo pa Kaeoperet, likwayo pa Peruda, <verse eid="EZR 2:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56" />likwayo pa Jaala, likwayo pa Darkon, likwayo pa Gidel, <verse eid="EZR 2:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57" />likwayo pa Cepatia, likwayo pa Katil, likwayo pa Poceret-kajebaim, ki likwayo pa Ami.<verse eid="EZR 2:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58" />Jo ma gitiyo i Ot pa Lubanga ki likwayo pa lutic pa Solomon onongo welgi romo miya adek ki pyere abongwen wiye aryo.<verse eid="EZR 2:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59" />Magi aye jo ma gubino ma gua ki i Tel-mela, Tel-karca, Kerub, Adan ki Imer, ento gin pe gutwero nyutu dog odi pa kwarogi, ki ikin jo Icrael: <verse eid="EZR 2:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60" />gin aye likwayo pa Delaya, likwayo pa Tobia, ki likwayo pa Nekoda, gin ducu miya abicel ki pyere abic wiye aryo. <verse eid="EZR 2:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61" />Dok jo magi gitye ikin likwayo pa ajwaki pa Lubanga: likwayo pa Kabaya likwayo pa Kakoj, ki likwayo pa Barjilai. (En yam onyomo dakone ki ikin anyira pa Barjilai ma jo Gilead. En yam kilwonge ki nying won dakone). <verse eid="EZR 2:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62" />Gin gubedo kayenyo nyinggi ikin lwak nying ma kicoyogi i buk me tekwaro, ento pe gunongo iye nyinggi, omiyo kikwanyogi woko ki ikin ajwaki calo jo ma komgi ki keni. <verse eid="EZR 2:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:63: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:21">Wel 27:21</ref></char></note>Laloyo ma Lajudaya otito botgi ni gin pe gunywak camo cam maleng wek pe guto, nio wang ma ajwaka pa Lubanga openyo dog Rwot ki Urim ki Tumim.<verse eid="EZR 2:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64" />Lwak ma gucoke ducu welgi romo alip pyere angwen wiye aryo ki miya adek ki pyere abicel, <verse eid="EZR 2:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65" />ma pe kikwano iye lwak luticgi ki angecagi ma welgi romo alip abiro ki miya adek ki pyere adek wiye abiro. Onongo gitye bene ki luwer ma co ki ma mon miya aryo. <verse eid="EZR 2:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66" />Aguraguragi yam tye miya abiro ki pyere adek wiye abicel, ki kanagi maditone miya aryo ki pyere angwen wiye abic, <verse eid="EZR 2:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67" />kinagagi romo miya angwen ki pyere adek wiye abic, ki kanagi romo alip abicel ki miya abiro ki pyere aryo.<verse eid="EZR 2:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68" />Ikare ma jo mogo ma ikin ludito wi kaka gubino i Ot pa Rwot matye i Jerucalem, gutyero gityer ma cwinygi opwoyo pi gero Ot pa Lubanga, i kabedone macon kikome. <verse eid="EZR 2:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69" />Gumiyo lim i ot kano lim me tic kit macalo gitwero, ma wele oromo kilo miya abic me jabu, ki ryal alip aryo ki miya aboro, ki bongi aruka pa ajwaki miya acel.<verse eid="EZR 2:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:70: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 9:2">1 Tek 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 11:3">Nek 11:3</ref></char>
    </note>Ajwaki pa Lubanga ki Lulevi ki jo mogo mukene gubedo i Jerucalem ki i kabedo ma cok kwede; luwer, lugwok dogola, ki lutic i Ot pa Lubanga i taun gi mapatpat, ki jo Icrael ducu bene gubedo i taun gi mapatpat.<verse eid="EZR 2:70" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kicako woro Rwot i Jerucalem odoco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1" />Ka dwe me abiro oromo, onongo dong jo Icrael gubedo mot i taun gi mapatpat, ci lwak gucoke i Jerucalem ki cwiny acel. <verse eid="EZR 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:1">Nia 27:1</ref></char></note>Cutcut Yocwa wod pa Jojadak kacel ki ajwaki luwote, ki Jerubabel wod pa Cealtiel ki lutugi, gucako cano keno tyer pa Lubanga pa Icrael, pi tyero iye gitum awanga, kit macalo yam kicoyo i Cik pa Moses ma dano pa Lubangani. <verse eid="EZR 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:1-8">Wel 28:1-8</ref></char></note> Kadi bed onongo gitye ki lworo pi lwak jo mukene ma gitye i lobo meno, gucano keno tyer kama yam onongo tye iye con. Ci gutyero iye gitum awanga bot Rwot, kun kiwango gitum odiko ki otyeno. <verse eid="EZR 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 29:12-38">Wel 29:12-38</ref></char></note> Gin bene gukwero nino madito me Bolo, kit ma con kicoyo, kun gityero gitum awanga nino ducu kun wele lubu cik ma mite pi nino acel acel. <verse eid="EZR 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:11-29:39">Wel 28:11—29:39</ref></char></note>Ka dong inge meno gumede ki tyero gitum awanga me nino ducu, gityer me Por Dwe, me nino madito ma Rwot ociko ducu, ki gityer ma dano acel acel miyo bot Rwot kit ma iye opwoyo. <verse eid="EZR 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6" />Cake ikom nino dwe mukwongo me dwe me abiro en aye gucako tyero iye gitum awanga bot Rwot. Ento guti me te Ot pa Rwot onongo pud peya kiketo.<verse eid="EZR 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kicako gero Ot pa Lubanga odoco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7" />Lwak gumiyo lim bot lupaa godi ki bot lupac. Dok gumiyo cam ki ginamata, ki moo bot jo Cidon ki jo Turo wek gukel yadi cedar ki i Lebanon kun wok ki i pii naka i dog nam me Jopa, ma lube kitwero ma Ciro rwot me Percia omiyo botgi. <verse eid="EZR 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8" />I mwaka me aryone ma lubu dwogogi i Jerucalem i Ot pa Lubanga, i dwe me aryo, en aye Jerubabel wod pa Cealtiel ki Yocwa wod pa Jojadak gucako kwede tic, kacel ki utmegigi mukene, kacel ki ajwaki pa Lubanga ki Lulevi ki jo ducu mayam gudok i Jerucalem ma gua ki i lobo kama kiterogi iye i opii. Guyero Lulevi, ma mwaka me ditogi romo pyere aryo ki makato pi ketogi me bedo ludito ma giloyo tic ikom Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="EZR 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9" />Yocwa ki awobene ki lutugi, ki Kadmiel ki awobene ma likwayo pa Juda, gin ducu guloyo lutic ma i Ot pa Lubanga, kacel ki awobe pa Kenadad ki Lulevi, ki lutinogi kacel ki lutugi.<verse eid="EZR 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 25:1">1 Tek 25:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka dong lugedo guketo guti me te Ot pa Rwot, ajwaki guruku ginaruka me tic meggi gukato kwede anyim ma gumako tumgi; ki Lulevi ma likwayo pa Acap onongo gitye ki atego agoya me pako Rwot, kit mayam Daudi rwot me Icrael ociko. <verse eid="EZR 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:34">1 Tek 16:34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2 Tek 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:3">7:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">Jab 100:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:11">Jer 33:11</ref></char></note>Guwero wer kun gileyo aleya, ma gipako Rwot dok gimiyo pwoc bote, kun giwero ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZR 3:11">“Pien Rwot ber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZR 3:11">mar mere ma pe loke bedo nakanaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZR 3:11">bot jo Icrael.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZR 3:11">Lwak ducu gudange ki woo madwong, ka gipako Rwot, pien dong kiketo guti me te Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="EZR 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12" />Ento lwak jo mapol ki ikin ajwaki pa Lubanga ki Lulevi ki ludito ma giloyo dog odi pa kwarigi, jo muteggi mayam guneno Ot pa Rwot mukwongo ca, gukok matek ki dwon malongo ikare ma guneno ka kitye kaketo guti me te Ot man, kadi bedi jo mapol onongo gubedo kadange ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="EZR 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13" />Ma omiyo dano onongo pe gitwero poko ikin dwon me yomcwiny ki dwon me koko, pien onongo lwak gubedo kadange matek tutwal, ma dwon gi winye wa ki kamabor.<verse eid="EZR 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4" />
  <para style="s1">Temo juku tic me Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1" />Ka lumerok pa jo Juda ki pa jo Benjamin guwinyo ni jo ma gudwogo ki i opii gitye kagero Ot pa Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, <verse eid="EZR 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:24-41">2 Luk 17:24-41</ref></char></note>ci cut gubino bot Jerubabel ki ludito ma giloyo dog odi pa kwarigi kun giwaco botgi ni, “Wuwek waribe kwedwu i gedo man, pien wan bene waworo Lubangawu macalo wun, dok wan bene wabedo katyero gitum bote cake wa ikare pa Ecar-kadon rwot me Aciria mayam okelowa kany.”<verse eid="EZR 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3" />Ento Jerubabel, ki Yocwa, ki ludito mukene ma giloyo dog odi pa kwarigi ma i Icrael gugamo doggi ni, “Wun pe wutwero ribe kwedwa me gero ot mo pi Lubangawa; wan kenwa watwero gero ot pi Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, macalo rwot Ciro, rwot me Percia yam ociko ki wan.”<verse eid="EZR 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4" />Ka dok lwak jo mukene ma gitye i lobo kunu gucako balo cwiny jo Juda woko, omiyo gubedo ki lworo me gedo. <verse eid="EZR 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5" />Jo meno gumiyo lim me wilo luloc me Percia cake ikare pa rwot Ciro nio kwede wa ikare pa rwot Dario wek obal ticgi woko.<verse eid="EZR 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EST 1:1">Est 1:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>I acaki me loc pa Akacwero, lumone pa jo Juda ki Jerucalem, gucoyo lok me adot ikom jo ma gibedo i Juda ki i Jerucalem.<verse eid="EZR 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7" />Ikare me loc pa Aritakcec, jo magi Biclam ki Mitredat ki Tabcel ki ludito wadgi ducu, gucoyo waraga bot Aritakcec rwot me Percia. Kicoyo ki leb Aramaik kun kigonyo tere ikare ma kikwano. <verse eid="EZR 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8" />Rekum ma en ladit me mony ki Cimcai ma karan gucoyo waraga bot rwot Aritakcec ma tito lok ikom Jerucalem kit man ni:<verse eid="EZR 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9" />“Rekum ma ladit me mony, ki Cimcai ma karan gucoyo waraga man kacel ki ludito wadgi ducu, lungolkop, ki luloc me lobo, ki ludito pa jo Percia ki jo Erek, ki jo Babilon, ki jo Cuca, ma gin aye jo Elam, <verse eid="EZR 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10" />kacel ki lwak rok mukene ducu mayam laker madit me awora Ocnapar okobogi woko omiyo gubedo i taun madito ma i lobo Camaria ki i kabedo mukene mapatpat ma i dul lobo ma kilwongo Kupotoceng me Kulu Euprate.”<verse eid="EZR 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11" />Man aye kopi me waraga ma gucwalo bote, ma loke kwane kit man:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="EZR 4:11">“Bot rwot Aritakcec: wan lutici ma wabedo i lobo me kupotoceng me Kulu Euprate, wacwalo motwa boti.<verse eid="EZR 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12" />Wek rwot onge ni Lujudaya ma gua ki boti gudwogo botwa, kombedi dong gutyeko cito woko i Jerucalem. Gitye kagero taun madit pa jo ma lujemoni odoco, kun gin jo maracu. Kombedi dong gicok katyeko tic ikom cel murumu gang, dok gitye kayubu tegutine. <verse eid="EZR 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13" />Myero in rwot dong inge lok man ni, kace taun madit man kigero odoco, ka kigero cel otum, ci pe dong gibimiyo ajog dok pe gibiculu kit mucoro mo. Dok lim ma gibicwalo bot in rwot bene bijwik woko. <verse eid="EZR 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14" />Kit macalo wan lutic i gang kal pa rwot, pe bedo ber ka waweko kituru tweroni woko ma kun wan waneno anena, ma omiyo wacwalo lok man pi titone boti in rwot, <verse eid="EZR 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15" />wek kong kinen dok kiyeny lok i buk ma kicoyo iye lok mutime ikom kwariwu. Ibinongo ilok ma kicoyo i buk me lok ma otime ma bimiyo iniang atir ni taun madit man kara taun madit me jemo ada, ma miyo can ki arem ikom luker ki luloc me lobo, pi atubegi ma ocake magwa i taun madit meno nia wacon. Meno aye gin ma omiyo yam kimuku taun madit man woko. <verse eid="EZR 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16" />Wamito in rwot inge ni, kace taun madit man kigero odoco, ki cel bene otum, in dong pe ibibedo ki twero mo ikom lobo ma kupotoceng me Euprate.”<verse eid="EZR 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17" />Rwot ocwalo botgi lagam me waraga kit man,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="EZR 4:17">“Bot Rekum ladit me mony ki Cimcai karan, ki lwak ducu ma gin ludito wadiwu ma gibedo i Camaria ki i lobo ducu me kupotoceng me Euprate, amotowu. <verse eid="EZR 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18" />Dong amito wunge ni waraga ma wucwalo botwa kany gikwano ducu maber i nyima. <verse eid="EZR 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19" />Ci dong amiyo twero, ci kikwedo ki kore wa ki i buk, ci kinongo ada ni, Jerucalem nia wa ikare macon, obedo kajemo woko ikom luker ducu, dok ni jemo kacel ki atube obedo katime iye. <verse eid="EZR 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20" />Ki luker matego yam gubedo kaloyo Jerucalem, ma guloyo bene wa ki lobo ducu me kupotoceng me Euparate, ma lwak gubedo kaculu ajog ki mucoro ducu botgi. <verse eid="EZR 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21" />Pieno myero wuket cik wek kijuk jo meno woko, wek taun madit man pe dok kiger odoco, nio wang ma an kikoma aketo cik. <verse eid="EZR 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22" />Wuket cwinywu ikom lok meno, pe wubed ata ma pe wungeyo ticwu. Pe omyero wuwek kitim gin mo ma balo cobo gin ma rwot mito.”<verse eid="EZR 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23" />Ikare ma dong kikwano waraga pa rwot Aritakcec inyim Rekum ki Cimcai ma karan ki bot ludito wadgi ducu, gucako cito oyotoyot bot Lujudaya ma onongo gitye i Jerucalem ci gujukugi woko ki tek wek pe gumede ki roco Jerucalem.<verse eid="EZR 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tic i Ot pa Lubanga ocake odoco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:24—5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAG 1:1">Agg 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 1:1">Jek 1:1</ref></char>
    </note>Tic ikom Ot pa Lubanga matye i Jerucalem onongo ocung woko nio wa i mwaka me aryo me loc pa Dario rwot me Percia.<verse eid="EZR 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1" />Ikare meno, lunebi magi, Aggai ki Jekaria wod pa Iddo, gutito lok bot Lujudaya ma gitye i Juda ki i Jerucalem, i nying Lubanga pa Icrael ma loyogi. <verse eid="EZR 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 1:12">Agg 1:12</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:6-9">Jek 4:6-9</ref></char></note>Ka Jerubabel wod pa Cealtiel ki Yocwa wod pa Jojadak guwinyo lokgi ci gucako roco Ot pa Lubanga matye i Jerucalem odoco; kun lunebi pa Lubanga aryoni konyogi ki tic.<verse eid="EZR 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3" />Ikare meno kikome en aye Tatenai ma laloc me dul lobo matye kupotoceng me Euprate ki Cetar-bojenai ki ludito wadgi gubino botgi ci guloko kwedgi kit man ni, “Anga ma omiyowu twero me gero Ot pa Lubanga ki me tyeko gedone?” <verse eid="EZR 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4" />Jo man bene openyogi ni, “Lugedo ma gitye kagedoni nyinggi angagi?” <verse eid="EZR 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5" />Ento Lubanga yam tye kaneno ludongo pa Lujudaya, omiyo pe kijuku ticgi nio ka lok ma kicwaloni oo bot Dario, ma kun kikuru lagam me waraga ma kibidwoko pi lok meno.<verse eid="EZR 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6" />Man aye lok ma i waraga ma Tatenai ma en laloc me dul lobo matye kupotoceng me Euprate ki Cetar-bojenai ki ludito wadgi ducu gucoyo ci gucwalo bot Dario.<verse eid="EZR 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7" />Gucwalo lok ma kicoyo kit man ni, “Bot rwot Dario, kuc obed boti.<verse eid="EZR 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8" />Myero in rwot inge ni wan wacito i lobo Juda, wao wa i Ot pa Lubanga madit. Kitye karocone ki godi apaya madongo, kiguro bao bene me umu kom ot nia ki i dye ot piny nio kwede wa i kwori me dan ot ducu; tic man tye kawot mot maber tutwal dok tice ye cing gi maber.<verse eid="EZR 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9" />Wan wapenyo ludongo ma kunu ka waloko botgi kit man ni, ‘Anga ma omiyowu twero me gero Ot pa Lubanga ki me tyeko cel ma orumu ducu?’ <verse eid="EZR 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10" />Ka dok wapenyo wa nyinggi bene, wek watit boti, ka wacoyo nying ludito ma gitelo wigi.<verse eid="EZR 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11" />Gin gugamo dogwa kit man ni, ‘Wan lutic pa Lubanga me polo ki lobo, wan watye kagero Ot pa Lubanga odoco, en Ot mayam gedone otero lwak mwaka mapol mukato angec, ma rwot madit pa jo Icrael con ogero nio wa ityekone. <verse eid="EZR 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:8-12">2 Luk 25:8-12</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:17-20">2 Tek 36:17-20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:12-15">Jer 52:12-15</ref></char></note>Ento ka kwariwa yam gumiyo kiniga omako Lubanga me polo ikomgi, ci omiyogi i cing Nebukadnejar ma Lakaldaya, rwot me Babilon, ma obalo Ot pa Lubanga woko, ka oterogi wa i lobo Babilon. <verse eid="EZR 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:2-11">Eji 1:2-11</ref></char></note>Ento i mwaka mukwongo me loc pa Ciro rwot me Babilon, Ciro oketo cik ma miyo twero ni Ot pa Lubanga man myero kiger odoco. <verse eid="EZR 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14" />Dok bene jami me jabu ki me ryal mayam kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Lubanga, mayam Nebukadnejar oyako ki i Ot pa Lubanga mayam tye i Jerucalem ci oterogi oketogi i ot pa lubangagu ma i Babilon, jami magi ducu rwot Ciro aceli aye yam okwanyogi woko ki i ot pa lubangagu matye i Babilon, ka omiyogi bot dano ma nyinge Cecbajar, mayam Ciro oketo obedo laloc; <verse eid="EZR 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15" />ka dok ocike ni, kwany jami magi itergi icit iketgi i Ot pa Lubanga matye i Jerucalem, ka dok iwek kiger Ot pa Lubanga odoco i kabedone kikome. <verse eid="EZR 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16" />Ci Cecbajar obino oketo teguti me Ot pa Rwot Lubanga ma i Jerucalem; cake wa ikare ca nio wa koni gubedo kagerone, ma pud bene peya otum.’<verse eid="EZR 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17" />Kace in rwot ineno ni tye atir, wek kong kiyeny loke i ot kano lok ma kicoyo matye i Babilon, wek ginen atir ka yam rwot Ciro oketo cik ma omiyo twero me roco Ot pa Lubanga man matye i Jerucalem. Kong in rwot inen kit ma ingolo kwede loke ci ocwal botwa.”<verse eid="EZR 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kinongo cik mayam Ciro omiyo pi gedo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1" />Rwot Dario omiyo twero, ci kiyenyo loke i Babilon ki i ot me kano lok kama kigwoko iye buk me lok mayam kicoyo. <verse eid="EZR 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2" />Ci kinongo buk mayam kicoyo iye lok ma otime i taun madit me Ekbatana ma en aye gang kal me lobo Media, ma kicoyo iye lok magi mayam otime:<verse eid="EZR 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3" />“I mwaka mukwongo me loc pa rwot Ciro, en omiyo twero ni, Ot pa Lubanga ma i Jerucalem, myero kiger odoco, pien obedo kama kityero iye tyer ki gitum awanga. Bore me dok malo myero obed mita pyere aryo wiye abiro ki lace bene mita pyere aryo wiye abiro <verse eid="EZR 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4" />Kore omyero kiged ki godi apaya madongo, latyeng adek ma gurumu ot woko ducu ki bao tyeng acel. Lim me culu pi tic bia ki i kicaa lim me ker. <verse eid="EZR 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5" />Dok bene wuwek jami me jabu ki me ryal me Ot pa Lubanga, mayam Nebukadnejar oyakogi ci okelogi i Babiloni kidwokgi cen ci kiketgi i Ot pa Lubanga matye i Jerucalem, kun jami acel acel kiketo i kabedone kikome; i Ot pa Lubanga.”<verse eid="EZR 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6" />Ci Dario odwoko lok botgi kitman:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="EZR 6:6">“Pi meno in Tatenai, laloc me lobo me kupotoceng me Euprate, ki Cetar-bojenai, ki ludito wadiwu luloc mukene ma gitye i lobo me kupotoceng me Euprate, wunyik woko cen ki i Ot pa Lubanga: <verse eid="EZR 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7" />wuwek tic me Ot pa Lubanga owot anyim kit ma mite. Wuwek laloc pa Lujudaya ki ludongo pa Lujudaya guger Ot pa Lubanga odoco ikom kabedone macon kikome. <verse eid="EZR 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8" />Dok acikowu me konyo ludongo magi pa Lujudaya ki gero Ot pa Lubanga odoco; myero kicul lim ma mite bot jo magi labongo gale, kun kikwanyo lime ki ikom lim me ker ma kijogo, ma oa ki i lobo me kupotoceng me Euprate. <verse eid="EZR 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9" />Kace ajwaki pa Lubanga ma gitye i Jerucalem gimito lutino twoni, ki nyogi romi, nyo romi me gitum awanga me atyera bot Lubanga me polo, nyo ngano, kado, ki kongo bwino, nyo moo, ci omyero wumii gin meno botgi nino ducu ma pe wukeng. <verse eid="EZR 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10" />Wubitimo kit man wek gutyer gityer ma Lubanga me Polo pwoyo, ki lego pi kwo pa rwot ki lutinone. <verse eid="EZR 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11" />Dok amiyo twero ni kace dano mo oturu cik man, ci rii wi ot ma mere kibiwoto woko, kibipayo yaka kicobe kwede. Dok kiwek ode odok odur yugi. <verse eid="EZR 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12" />Ka rwot mo nyo rok mo oete me temo loko cik man, nyo balo Ot pa Lubanga man matye i Jerucalem, ci Lubanga mayam oyero kabedo man ni wek obed kabedo me wore omyero otur twerogi woko. An Dario, amiyo twero ni kiwek tic otiine kakare ki mitkom kun kilubu cik man maber.”<verse eid="EZR 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikwero Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13" />Ka rwot Dario ocwalo kwenane, ci Tatenai, ma laloc me dul lobo me kupotoceng me Euprate, ki Cetar-bojenai, ki ludito wadgi, gutiyo tic ki mitkom kit ma rwot Dario ociko. <verse eid="EZR 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 1:1">Agg 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 1:1">Jek 1:1</ref></char></note>Ludongo pa Lujudaya gugedo gedo ma tic bene omede owoto anyim maber, pi lok me cuku cwiny ma lanebi Aggai ki Jekaria wod pa Iddo gutito. Gutyeko tic me gedo kit macalo ceng Lubanga pa Icrael ocikogi kwede ki pi cik pa Ciro, Dario ki pa Aritakcec rwodi me Percia. <verse eid="EZR 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15" />Gutyeko tic me gedo me Ot pa Lubanga man inino dwe adek me dwe me Adar, i mwaka me abicel me loc pa rwot Dario.<verse eid="EZR 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16" />Lacen jo Icrael, ajwaki ki Lulevi, kacel ki jo mukene mayam gudwogo cen ki i opii i rok, gukwero Ot pa Lubanga ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="EZR 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17" />Inino me kwero Ot pa Lubanga kikome gutyero twoni miya acel, ki nyogi romi miya aryo, lutino romi miya angwen, ki nyogi dyegi apar wiye aryo, ma oporo wel kaka pa jo Icrael pi gitum me bal pi jo Icrael ducu. <verse eid="EZR 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18" />Gupoko ajwaki ki Lulevi i dul, pi tic pa Lubanga i Jerucalem, kun kilubu gin ma kicoyo i buk pa Moses.<verse eid="EZR 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Karama me Kato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Nia 12:1-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jo ma gudwogo cen ki i opii gukwero Karama me Kato inino dwe apar wiye angwen me dwe mukwongo. <verse eid="EZR 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20" />Onongo ajwaki ducu kacel ki Lulevi dong gutyeko lonye keken gi; gin ducu gudoko leng. Omiyo guneko lutino romi me gitum pi jo ducu mayam gudwogo ma gua ki i opii, ki pi ajwaki luwotgi, ki pirgi ken gi. <verse eid="EZR 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21" />Jo Icrael ma gudwogo ma gua ki i opii i rok aye gubedo kacamone, kacel ki jo ducu ma dong guweko kwo me kafiri ma gupoke woko ki ikin lwak ma gin wegi lobo, gubino kaworo Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael. <verse eid="EZR 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22" />Ka dok gukwero nino madito me Mugati ma Tobi Pe iye ki yomcwiny pi nino abiro; pien Rwot omiyogi yomcwiny, dok oloko cwiny rwot me Aciria ikomgi, wek okonygi ki tic me gero Ot pa Lubanga, Lubanga pa Icrael.<verse eid="EZR 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ejira ki lwake guo i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1" />Lacen ki inge lok man, ikare ma onongo Aritakcec rwot me Percia aye loyo lobo, Ejira oa ki i lobo Babilon odok i Jerucalem. Ejira yam obedo wod pa Ceraya, wod pa Ajaria, wod pa Ilkia, <verse eid="EZR 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2" />wod pa Calum, wod pa Jadok, wod pa Akitub, <verse eid="EZR 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3" />wod pa Amaria, wod pa Ajaria, wod pa Merayot, <verse eid="EZR 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4" />wod pa Jerakia, wod pa Uji, wod pa Bukki, <verse eid="EZR 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5" />wod pa Abicua, wod pa Finekaci, wod pa Eleajar, wod pa Aron ma obedo ajwaka madit. <verse eid="EZR 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6" />Ejira yam obedo karan dok laryeko i Cik pa Moses macon Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael omiyo ki Moses. Rwot Aritakcec omiye jami ducu mayam en olego, pien Rwot Lubangane onongo tye kakonye.<verse eid="EZR 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7" />Jo ma gucito kwede i Jerucalem bene i mwaka me abiro me loc pa Aritakcec, obedo ajwaki ki Lulevi, luwer, lugwok dogola, ki lutic i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="EZR 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8" />En oo i Jerucalem i dwe me abic, me mwaka me abiro me loc pa Aritakcec. <verse eid="EZR 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9" />Gua ki i lobo Babilon inino dwe acel me dwe me acel, ci ki kony pa Lubanga guo i Jerucalem inino dwe acel me dwe me abic. <verse eid="EZR 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10" />Ejira yam oketo cwinye kakwano ki niang Cik pa Rwot, kun tiyo, lubu, dok pwonyo cike ki gin ma en ociko ducu bot jo Icrael.<verse eid="EZR 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma rwot Aritakcec ocwalo bot Ejira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11" />Man aye kopi me waraga ma rwot Aritakcec yam omiyo bot ajwaka Ejira, ma lapwonycik pa Lubanga, dano ma opwonye i tyen lok me Cik pa Rwot ki cik ma Rwot ociko ki jo Icrael. Loke kwane kitman ni:<verse eid="EZR 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12" />“An Aritakcec rwot maloyo luker ducu, amiyo waraga man bot ajwaka Ejira, ma Lapwonycik pa Lubanga me polo. <verse eid="EZR 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13" />An kombedi amiyo twero ni dano mo keken ki ikom jo Icrael nyo ajwakigi nyo Lulevigi ma gitye ite loca ma oye mine kene me cito i Jerucalem, myero ocit kacel kwedi. <verse eid="EZR 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14" />An rwot kacel ki lumiitam ma mera abiro aye wacwali wek icit ipeny lok matye i Juda ki i Jerucalem, me neno kit macalo Cik pa Lubangawu, mayam omiyo i cingini, kitye kalubune kwede. <verse eid="EZR 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15" />Myero iter ryal ki jabu ma an kacel ki lumiitam wamiyo ki yomcwiny me atyera bot Lubanga pa Icrael, ma ode tye i Jerucalem. <verse eid="EZR 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16" />Dok bene myero iter ryal ki jabu ma in icoko ki i lobo Babilon ducu, ki gityer ma ic opwoyo ma jo Icrael kacel ki ajwaki gumiyo, ma gukwongo kwong me miyo gin mo kit macalo cwiny dano acel acel omito pi Ot pa Lubangagi matye i Jerucalem.<verse eid="EZR 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17" />Dong myero igwoke itii ki lim man maber me wilo twoni dyangi, nyogi romi, ki gityer me moko kwon ki kongo bwino, ka icak tyerogi ikom keno tyer ma i Ot pa Lubangawu matye i Jerucalem. <verse eid="EZR 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18" />Dok in ki utmegi wutwero tic ki ryal ki jabu mogo ma odong kit macalo wuneno ni ber, kun wulubu cik pa Lubangawu. <verse eid="EZR 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19" />Dok myero iter lwak jami tic ma kimiyo boti me tic kwedgi i Ot pa Lubanga, kun ibiterogi ducu inyim Lubanga i Jerucalem. <verse eid="EZR 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20" />Ka tye gin mo mukene ma mite pi Ot pa Lubangawu, ma myero in inong, ci itwero wilone ki lim ma gikwanyo ki i ot kano lim pa rwot.”<verse eid="EZR 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21" />“An rwot Aritakcec, amiyo twero bot lukan lim ducu ma gitye i lobo me kupotoceng me Euprate ni, gin ducu ma ajwaka Ejira, ma Lapwonycik pa Lubanga me polo, bimito ki botwu, myero wumii bote oyotoyot ki mitkom, <verse eid="EZR 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22" />ma wele romo kilo alip adek ki miya angwen me ryal, kilo alip apar me ngano, ki kongo bwino lita alip aryo, ki lita alip aryo me moo jeituni, ki kado ma wele pe kinyutu. <verse eid="EZR 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23" />Gin ducu ma Lubanga me polo ociko, wutii kakare kikore i tic ikom Ot pa Lubanga me polo, wek akemo pe omake ikoma ki ikom jo ma bibedo i loc ikare me anyim. <verse eid="EZR 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24" />Dok bene wagengowu ni pe myero wujog lim me mucoro mo ki bot ajwaki, Lulevi, luwer, lugwok dogola, ki lutic ma gitiyo i Ot pa Lubanga, nyo lutic mukene ma gitiyo i Ot pa Lubanga.<verse eid="EZR 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25" />In Ejira, tii ki ryeko ma Lubangani omiyi, ket lungolkop madito ki lungolkop matino wek gubed ka ngolo kop pa lwak ducu ma gibedo i lobo me kupotoceng me Euprate; dok myero gubed jo ma gingeyo Cik pa Lubangawu. Jo ma pe gingeyo cik pa Lubangawu, in ipwonygi wek gunge. <verse eid="EZR 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26" />Kace ngat mo pe bilubu Cik pa Lubangawu kacel ki cik me lobona, myero kimiye pwod magwar, macalo kop me to, nyo kop me ryeme woko ki i loboni, nyo me yako jamine woko, nyo pi tweyo en i buc.”<verse eid="EZR 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ejira opako Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27" />Ejira owaco ni, “Kipwo Rwot Lubanga pa kwariwa! En aye ma oketo gin macalo man i cwiny rwot, pi keto deyo ikom Ot pa Rwot Lubanga ma i Jerucalem maberi. <verse eid="EZR 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28" />Dok onyutu bota mar mere ma pe loke inyim rwot kacel ki lumiitame ducu, ki inyim ludito ma gin twoni oteka pa rwot. An abedo ki tekcwiny pien Rwot Lubangana onongo tye ka konya dok abito ludito wi kaka pa jo Icrael ci adok cen kacel kwedgi.”<verse eid="EZR 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8" />
  <para style="s1">Jo ma gudwogo ki i opii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1" />Magi aye nying ludito ma giloyo dog odi pa kwarigi, ma gudwogo kacel kweda ki i lobo Babilon, ikare me loc pa rwot Aritakcec, <verse eid="EZR 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2" />ma kicoyo nyinggi i buk me tekwaro:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 8:2">Gercom, ki ikin likwayo pa Finekaci. Daniel, ki ikin likwayo pa Itamar. Katuc, ki ikin likwayo pa Daudi, <verse eid="EZR 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3" />ma ikin likwayo pa Cekania. Jekaria, ki ikin likwayo pa Paroc, kacel ki jo meggi ma kicoyo nyinggi. Gin ducu romo miya acel ki pyere abic. <verse eid="EZR 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4" />Eliekoenai wod pa Jerakia, ki ikin likwayo pa Pakat-moab, kacel ki jone ma welgi oromo miya aryo. <verse eid="EZR 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5" />Cekania wod pa Jakajiel, ki ikin likwayo pa Jatu, kacel ki jone miya adek. <verse eid="EZR 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6" />Ebed wod pa Yonacan, ki ikin likwayo pa Adin, kacel ki jone pyere abic. <verse eid="EZR 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7" />Jecaya wod pa Atalia, ki ikin likwayo pa Elam, kacel ki jone pyere abiro. <verse eid="EZR 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8" />Jebadia wod pa Mikael, ki ikin likwayo pa Cepatia, kacel ki jone pyere aboro. <verse eid="EZR 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9" />Obadia wod pa Jekiel, ki ikin likwayo pa Joab, kacel ki jone miya aryo ki apar wiye aboro. <verse eid="EZR 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10" />Celomit wod pa Jocipia, ki ikin likwayo pa Bani, kacel ki jone miya acel ki pyere abicel. <verse eid="EZR 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11" />Jekaria, wod pa Bebai, ki ikin likwayo pa Bebai, kacel ki jone pyere aryo wiye aboro. <verse eid="EZR 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12" />Yokanan wod pa Kakatan, ki ikin likwayo pa Ajgad, kacel ki jone miya acel ki apar. <verse eid="EZR 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13" />Elipelet, Jeuel, ki Cemaya, ki ikin likwayo pa Adonikam, jo ma gucito lacen, kacel ki jo meggi pyere abicel. <verse eid="EZR 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14" />Utai ki Jakur, ki ikin likwayo pa Bigvai, kacel ki jo meggi pyere abiro.<verse eid="EZR 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ejira onongo Lulevi pi tic i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15" />An, Ejira yam acokogi kacel i dog kulu ma mol dok tung taun me Akava, wagony iye wabedo kunu pi nino adek. Ka abedo kangiyo dano anongo ni ajwaki gitye, ento Lulevi pe gitye kadi ki acel mo. <verse eid="EZR 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16" />Ka dok acwalo kwena me lwongo jo magi, Eliejer, Ariel, Cemaya, Elnatan, Jarib, Elnatan, Natan, Jekaria, ki Meculam, gin aye ludito wi lwakgi dok alwongo Joyarib ki Elnatan mayam gin jo matye ki niang matut, <verse eid="EZR 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17" />ka acwalogi bot Iddo, ma en ladit maloyo kabedo me Kacipia, kun atito botgi lok ducu ma myero gin gucilok bot Iddo ki utmegine ma gin lutic i Ot pa Lubanga ma i kabedo me Kacipia, me cwalo botwa dano ma gibitic i Ot pa Lubangawa. <verse eid="EZR 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18" />Pi Rwot Lubangawa ma onongo tye kakonyowa omiyo gucwalo botwa Cerebia dano ma ngeyo piny, ma en tye ikin likwayo pa Makali ma en lakwar Levi dok lakwar Icrael bene; en obino ki lutinone kacel ki utmegine, gin ducu apar wiye aboro; <verse eid="EZR 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19" />ka dok gucwalo Kacabia ki Jecaya ma gitye ikin likwayo pa Merari, kacel ki utmegigi, ki lutinogi gin ducu pyere aryo. <verse eid="EZR 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20" />Dong medo ikom lutic i Ot pa Lubanga miya aryo ki pyere aryo, ma con Daudi ki luditone guketo pi tic bot Lulevi, gin ducu kicoyo nyinggi woko piny kore ki kore.<verse eid="EZR 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ejira otelo wi lwak ikare me rii kec ki lega</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21" />Ci aciko pi rii kec ki i dog kulu me Akava, wek wamwole kenwa inyim Lubangawa, wek waleg en omii ki wan wawot maber, wan kikomwa, lutinowa, kacel ki jamiwa ducu. <verse eid="EZR 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22" />Kono nene apenyo rwot ni omiya lwak acikari ki wegi aguragura me gwokowa ikom lumerokwa ma i yo, onongo lewic twero maka; pien onongo dong watito bot rwot woko ni, “Lubangawa bibedo ki jo ma giyenye pi konyogi, ki tek me akemone bedo ikom jo ducu ma gibwoto en woko.” <verse eid="EZR 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23" />Warii kec kun walego Lubangawa ni ogwokwa, ci en owinyo legawa bene.<verse eid="EZR 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot pi Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24" />Ka dok aketo ludito magi apar wiye aryo me loyo ajwaki: Cerebia, Kacabia, ki jo apar mukene ma gin utmegigi kacel kwedgi. <verse eid="EZR 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25" />Ci apimo botgi ryal ki jabu ki jami me tic, amiyogi gityer me Ot pa Lubangawa ma con rwot ki lumiitame ki luditone ki jo Icrael ducu ma gitye ikare meno gumiyo. <verse eid="EZR 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26" />Apimo ryal maromo kilo alip pyere aryo wiye aryo, ki jami mukene me ryal maromo miya acel, ki jabu maromo kilo alip adek ki miya angwen, <verse eid="EZR 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27" />ki atabo jabu pyere aryo ma acel acel peke romo kilo aboro ki gram miya angwen, ki atabo mola aryo ma kiliyo maber marom ki jami me jabu. <verse eid="EZR 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28" />Awaco botgi ni, “Wun dano maleng inyim Rwot, ki jami ducu bene leng; ryal ki jabu ducu gin aye mot me gityer ma cwiny dano opwoyo me miyone bot Rwot Lubanga pa kwariwu. <verse eid="EZR 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29" />Wugwokgi, wunen gi maber nio ka wupimogi inyim ajwaki madito ki Lulevi kacel ki ludito ma giloyo dog odi pa kwarigi ma i Jerucalem, kun wupimo ki i kicika ma i Ot pa Rwot.” <verse eid="EZR 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30" />Ajwaki ki Lulevi gutingo ryal ki jabu ma gupimo kacel ki jami mukene ducu, guterogi guketo i Ot pa Lubangawa i Jerucalem.<verse eid="EZR 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wot me dok i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31" />Lacen wacako wot ki i dog kulu Akaya inino me apar wiye aryo me dwe me acel, me cito i Jerucalem; Lubangawa aye obedo kakonyowa, dok ogwokowa ki i cing lumerok ki i cing lulibo ma gubutu kakiyowa i yoo. <verse eid="EZR 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32" />Ka wao i Jerucalem, ci wabedo kunu pi nino adek. <verse eid="EZR 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33" />Inino me angwene, wacito i Ot pa Lubangawa, wacako pimo iye ryal ki jabu ki jami tic ducu wamiyogi i cing ajwaka Meremot, ma wod pa Uria. Onongo en tye kacel ki Eleajar wod pa Finekaci, kacel ki Lulevi ma gitye kwedgi, ma gin aye Jojabad wod pa Yocwa ki Noadia wod pa Binui. <verse eid="EZR 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34" />Kikwano jami woko liweng, dok kipimogi bene ka kicoyo pekgi i buk i cawa meno.<verse eid="EZR 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35" />Ikare meno jo mayam gudwogo ki i opii i rok, gucako tyero gitum awanga bot Lubanga pa Icrael. Gutyero twoni dyangi apar wiye aryo pi jo Icrael ducu, ki nyogi romi pyere abongwen wiye abicel, ki lutino nyogi romi pyere abiro wiye abiro, ki nyogi dyegi apar wiye aryo pi gitum me bal; meno ducu obedo gitum awanga bot Rwot. <verse eid="EZR 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36" />Gin gumiyo cik pa rwot Dario bot rwodi ki bot luloc ma gitye i lobo me kupotoceng me kulu Euprate; ci gin bene gukonyo dano kacel ki Ot pa Lubanga.<verse eid="EZR 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ejira oniang ikom nyom matye ikin Lurok ki Lujudaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1" />Ikare ma nyom ikin Lujudaya ki lurok otyeko time, ludito gubino bota gutita ni, “Jo Icrael, ajwaki, kacel ki Lulevi, pud peya gupoke woko ki ikom jo mukene ma gibedo i lobo meno kun gibedo ken gi. Gin tye katimo tim kipyeda ki jo Kanaan, jo Kit, jo Periji, jo Jebuc, jo Ammon, jo Moab, jo Ejipt, ki jo Amor. <verse eid="EZR 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2" />Co ma gin Lujudaya gitye kanyomo anyira rok wek obed mon gi kikomgi ki mon pa lutinogi; omiyo kwayi jo maleng pa Lubanga dong gurube woko kacel ki jo mukene ma gibedo i lobo man omiyo gudoko keni. Ludito ma gin loyo lwak kacel ki rwodi aye gubedo lubal madongo ilok man.” <verse eid="EZR 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3" />Ka awinyo lok meno, ci ayeco ginarukana woko, ka aputu yer wiya ki dok aputu yer tika bene, acako bedo ma piny orem kweda woko. <verse eid="EZR 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4" />Lacen jo ducu ma komgi omyel ka guwinyo lok pa Lubanga pa Icrael, pi ngayo wang Lubanga ma jo ma gudwogo ki i opii gubedo kwede, ci gucako gure guruma woko dyere ma abedo ma piny orem kweda woko nio wa ikare ma kityero gitum me otyeno. <verse eid="EZR 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5" />Ikare meno ma kityero gitum me otyeno en aye aa woko kwede ki kama onongo abedo karii kec iyeni, ma ginarukana ducu guyec woko, ka arumu conga piny ma atango cinga bot Rwot Lubangana, <verse eid="EZR 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6" />kun awace ni, “Ai Lubanga, lewic maka mada me ilo wiya ka atye inyimi , ai Lubangana, pien bal ma wan watimo odure madit lipim makato wiwa woko, ki alii mewa otore madit lipim malo oo wa i polo. <verse eid="EZR 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7" />Cake ikare pa kwariwa nio wa kombedi wan ki lwaki wabedo katimo lwak bal mapol. Dong pi balwa, omiyo wan ki lukerwa, ki ajwakiwa yam kimiyowa i cing luker ma i lobo pa lurok, kinekowa ki pala lucwan, ki i rok kunu kiyakowa, dok ki timowa ki tim me lewic, macalo watye ikare man. <verse eid="EZR 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8" />Ento pi kare manok keken Rwot Lubangawa, kica omaki ikomwa, ci imiyo jo mukene ki ikinwa gubwot dok gubedo i kabedo malengngi mot maber. Lubangawa iweko wabwot ki i opii dok imiyowa kwo manyen. <verse eid="EZR 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9" />Onongo wan opii, ento in Lubangawa pe yam iwekowa ata ikare ma watye i opii. Ci inyutu mar meri ma pe loke ikomwa inyim luker me Percia, omiyo guwekowa makwo dok guye ni wager Ot pa Lubangawa odoco, ki yubu jami ma obale i obure, gin omiyo kigwokowa bene maber i Judaya ki i Jerucalem.<verse eid="EZR 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10" />Kombedi Ai Lubangawa, wan dok wawaco ango ki inge lok man ma otyeko timeni? Dong wabwoto lubu ciki woko ducu <verse eid="EZR 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11" />mayam iciko dok imiyo owok ki i dog lutici ma lunebi, kun iwaco ni, ‘Lobo ma wubidonyo iye kacamone me bedo mewu matwali, en aye lobo pa jo ma komgi ki keni, pien jo ma gibedo iye gupongo lobo meno woko ki tim me kipyeda nia tungcel nio kwede i agiki lobo tungcel dok gubedo jo ma komgi ki keni. <verse eid="EZR 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Nia 34:11-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:1-5">Nwo 7:1-5</ref></char></note>Ma omiyo wun pe wumii lutinogi gunyom anyirawu, ki lutinowu bene pe gunyom anyiragi, wun pe myero wuyeny kuc ki lonyogi ma gitye kwede; wek wubed jo matego, ki dok wucam gin maber ma i lobo, ma wubiweko bene bot lutinowu me bedo ginaleyagi matwal.’ <verse eid="EZR 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13" />Kadi bed jami magi ducu opoto ikomwa pi balwa ma watimogi ki pi alii madit ma watingo, wangeyo ni in Lubangawa iketo can ikomwa manok ma pe oporo lwak bal ma watimo, dok ikonyowa omiyo wabwot oweko pud watye makwo. <verse eid="EZR 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14" />Cake ningning ni wan dok pud wabituru ciki aye kun wamede ki nyom ikinwa ki jo ma gitiyo bal kipyedani? Itamoni ka watimo meno, kiniga pe bimaki ikomwa matek nio ka ityekowa ducu, ma dano mo acel ikinwa pe bibwot? <verse eid="EZR 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15" />Ai Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, in ipore, pien imiyo wabwot ki ilak to. Nen, watucu bal aliiwa boti, pe watye ki kit twero mo me cung inyimi pi bal man.”<verse eid="EZR 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yub me giko nyom ikin lurok ki jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1" />Ikare ma Ejira tye i ot ka lega kun kok, ci poto kwede piny i ngom kun tucu balgi, ci lwak jo Icrael ma co, mon ki lutinogi gucoke kun gikok matek tutwal. <verse eid="EZR 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2" />Cutcut Cekania wod pa Jekiel, ma ikin likwayo pa Elam, owaco bot Ejira ni, “Wangayo wang Lubangawa woko pi nyomo mon ma gin lurok ma gitye i lobo man, ento kadi bed kumeno pud gen tye pi jo Icrael. <verse eid="EZR 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3" />Wan kong dong waketu gicike ki Lubangawa me ryemo mon magi woko ducu kacel ki lutinogi. Wabitiyo gin ma in kacel ki jo mukene ma gilworo Cik pa Lubangawa bitito botwa ni watii; ci wabitiyo gin ducu ma Cik pa Lubanga mito. <verse eid="EZR 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4" />In ia malo, pien man tic ma meri, wan bene wabicung ingeyi; myero ibed tek dok itim kumeno.”<verse eid="EZR 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5" />Ka Ejira oa malo ci omiyo lutela pa ajwaki ki pa Lulevi ki pa jo Icrael ducu gukwongo kwong ni gibitiyo gin ma Cekania dong oloko ni kitii. Kitmeno gucako kwongo kwong. <verse eid="EZR 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6" />Ejira oa woko ki inyim Ot pa Lubanga, odonyo i kicika pa Yekokanan wod pa Eliacib, obutu kunu nino acel, kun pe camo gin mo kadi wa mato pii bene. Dok obedo kakumu pi jo ma gua ki i opii ma gungayo wang Lubanga wokoni.<verse eid="EZR 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7" />Ka dong kitito lok oromo i lobo Juda ki Jerucalem ki bot jo ducu ma ceng gudwogo ki i opii ni gin ducu omyero gucoke i Jerucalem. <verse eid="EZR 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8" />Kiciko ni ka dano mo pe obino ikin nino adeki, ludito ma giloyo lwak ki ludongo guwaco ni jamine ducu omyero kiyak ci kidyer ki Lubanga, ki en kikome bene myero kiryeme woko wek oa ki ikin lwak ma gudwogo ki i opii.<verse eid="EZR 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9" />Cutcut jo Juda ki jo Benjamin ducu gucoke i Jerucalem ikine me nino adek. Inino dwe pyere aryo me dwe me abongwen, lwak ducu gubedo idyekal ma inyim Ot pa Lubanga. Onongo kot obedo kacwer matek; pi lok man ma pire tek ki pi ngico, omiyo kom dano acel acel obedo kamyel amyela. <verse eid="EZR 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10" />Ajwaka Ejira oa malo ci owaco bot lwak ni, “Wun wuturu cik pa Lubanga omiyo wutingo alii wumedo ikom bal alii pa jo Icrael pi nyomo mon ma gin lurok. <verse eid="EZR 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11" />Wutuc balwu kombedi inyim Rwot Lubanga pa kwarowu, kun wutiyo gin ma en mito; dok myero wupoke woko pat ki ikom jo ma gibedo i lobo man, wuryem monwu ma gin luroki bene woko.”<verse eid="EZR 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12" />Lwak ducu gugamo ki dwon malongo ni, “Obed kitmeno, wabitiyo gin ducu ma dong iwaco.” <verse eid="EZR 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13" />Gin gumede guwace ni, “Lwak tye dwong mada dok bene obedo kare ma kot cwer iye madwong; pe watwero cung idyekal ata kit man. Man pe gin ma kitwero tiyo nino acel nyo aryo keken, pien wan watyeko timo bal madit tutwal i lok man. <verse eid="EZR 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14" />Wek ludito ma giloyowa aye gucung pi nying lwak ducu ma gucoke; wek gucik jo ducu ma gibedo i taunwa madito ma gunyomo mon ma gin lurok gubin inino ma kiciko, kacel ki ludongo ma loyogi ki lungolkop ma i taun madito ducu, nio wang ma kikwanyo kiniga pa Lubanga mager ki ikomwa pi lok man.” <verse eid="EZR 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15" />Ngat mo onongo pe okwero yub man, ento kono Yonacan wod pa Acakel ki Jakijeya wod pa Tikva keken aye gukwero, dok Meculam ki Cabetai ma gin Lulevi bene gukonyo korgi iye.<verse eid="EZR 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16" />Jo ma gudwogo ki i opii gutimo kitmeno. Ajwaka Ejira oyero dano, ludito maloyo dog odi pa kwarigi. Dano acel acel ma kiyero en ocoyo nyinge woko piny, kun lubu dog ot pa kwarone. Ikom nino dwe acel me dwe me apar en aye gubedo iye piny kaneno lok meno. <verse eid="EZR 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17" />Inino dwe acel me dwe me acel onongo dong gutyeko yenyo lok ikom co ducu mayam gunyomo mon ma gin lurok.<verse eid="EZR 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Co ma onongo gunyomo mon ma gin Lurok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18" />Magi aye nying co mayam gunyomo mon ma gin lurok ma gitye ikin likwayo pa ajwaki, gin aye Maceya, Eliejer, Jarib, ki Gedalia, ma gitye ikin likwayo pa Yocwa wod pa Jojadak kacel ki utmegine. <verse eid="EZR 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19" />Gin gucike pirgi ken gi me ryemo mon gi woko, ki dok gutyero gitum pi tingo aliigi ma obedo nyok romo ma gukwanyo ki ikom romigi pi tingo aliigi. <verse eid="EZR 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20" />Ikin likwayo pa Imer gin aye Kanani ki Jebadia. <verse eid="EZR 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21" />Ikin likwayo pa Karim: gin aye Maceya, Eliya, Cemaya, Jekiel, ki Ujia. <verse eid="EZR 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22" />Ikin likwayo pa Packur gin aye Elioenai, Maceya, Icmael, Natanel, ki Elaca. <verse eid="EZR 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23" />Jo ma ikin likwayo pa Lulevi: gin aye Jojabad, Cimei, Kelaya ma kilwongo bene ni, Kelita, ki Petakia, Juda, ki Eliejer. <verse eid="EZR 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24" />Ki i dul pa luwer gin aye Eliacib. Ki i dul pa lugwok dogola gin aye Calum, Telem, ki Uri. <verse eid="EZR 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25" />Ki ikom likwayo pa jo Icrael: ki ikin likwayo pa Paroc gin aye Ramia, Ijia, Malkija, Mijamin, Eleajar, Kacabia, ki Benaya. <verse eid="EZR 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26" />Ikin likwayo pa Elam gin aye Matania, Jekaria, Jekiel, Abdi, Jeremot, ki Eliya. <verse eid="EZR 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27" />Ikin likwayo pa Jatu gin aye Elioenai, Eliacib, Matania, Jeremot, Jabad, ki Ajija. <verse eid="EZR 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28" />Ikin likwayo pa Bebai gin aye Yekokanan, Anania, Jabai, ki Atlai. <verse eid="EZR 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29" />Ikin likwayo pa Bani gin aye Meculam, Maluk, Adaya, Jacub, Ceal, ki Jeremot. <verse eid="EZR 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30" />Ikin likwayo pa Pakat-moab gin aye Adna, Celal, Benaya, Maceya, Matania, Bejalel, Binui, ki Manace. <verse eid="EZR 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31" />Ikin likwayo pa Karim gin aye Eliejer, Icija, Malkija, Cemaya, Cimeon, <verse eid="EZR 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32" />Benjamin, Maluk, ki Cemaria. <verse eid="EZR 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33" />Ikin likwayo pa Kacum gin aye Matenai, Matata, Jabad, Elipelet, Jeremai, Manace, ki Cimei. <verse eid="EZR 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34" />Ikin likwayo pa Bani gin aye Madai, Amram, Uel, <verse eid="EZR 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35" />Benaya, Bedeya, Keluki, <verse eid="EZR 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36" />Vania, Meremot, Eliacib, <verse eid="EZR 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37" />Matania, Matenai, ki Jacu. <verse eid="EZR 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38" />Ikin likwayo pa Binui gin aye Cimei, <verse eid="EZR 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39" />Celemia, Natan, Adaya, <verse eid="EZR 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40" />Maknadebai, Cacai, Carai, <verse eid="EZR 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41" />Ajarel, Celemia, Cemaria, <verse eid="EZR 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42" />Calum, Amaria, ki Yucepu. <verse eid="EZR 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43" />Ki ikin likwayo pa Nebo gin aye Jeyel, Matitia, Jabad, Jebina, Jadai, Joel, ki Benaya. <verse eid="EZR 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44" />Jo magi ducu onongo yam gunyomo mon ma gin lurok, ci guryemogi woko kacel ki lutinogi ducu.<verse eid="EZR 10:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10" />
</usx>